sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Teacher as Faculty Member
    participant Client as React Client
    participant API as Express Auth API
    participant Resend as Resend / Brevo Email
    participant Supa as Supabase Auth & Database

    %% Registration Flow
    Note over Teacher,Supa: Phase 1: Faculty Registration with Email OTP
    Teacher->>Client: Enters Name, College, Email, Password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/register-initiate
    API->>Supa: Check duplicate in teachers table
    API->>Supa: Generate signup verification link & OTP (Admin API)
    API->>Resend: sendOtpEmail(to, name, otp)
    Resend-->>Teacher: Deliver 6-digit OTP code to Inbox
    API-->>Client: Return OTP dispatched confirmation
    Teacher->>Client: Enters 6-digit OTP code
    Client->>Supa: supabase.auth.verifyOtp(email, token)
    Supa-->>Client: OTP Verified OK
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/register-verified
    API->>API: bcrypt.hash(password, 10)
    API->>Supa: Insert new row into teachers table
    API->>API: jwt.sign({ id, name, email, collegeName }, JWT_SECRET, 7d)
    API-->>Client: Return JWT Token + Teacher Profile
    Client->>Client: Save token to localStorage & navigate to /dashboard

    %% Login Flow
    Note over Teacher,Supa: Phase 2: Faculty Password Login
    Teacher->>Client: Enters Email & Password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>Supa: Select teacher WHERE email = cleanEmail
    API->>API: bcrypt.compare(password, teacher.password)
    API->>API: jwt.sign(payload, JWT_SECRET, 7d)
    API-->>Client: Return JWT Token + Teacher Profile
    Client->>Client: Save token to localStorage & navigate to /dashboard

    %% Google OAuth Flow
    Note over Teacher,Supa: Phase 3: Faculty Google OAuth Sign-In
    Teacher->>Client: Clicks "Continue with Google"
    Client->>Supa: supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({ provider: 'google' })
    Supa-->>Client: OAuth Callback with access_token & user session
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/google { email }
    API->>Supa: Check if email exists in teachers table
    alt Teacher is Registered
        API->>API: Generate JWT Token
        API-->>Client: Return JWT Token + Teacher Profile
    else Not Registered
        API-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden ("Please register first")
        Client->>Supa: supabase.auth.signOut() (clear orphan session)
    end
